# x1 node el (n2_live's beesl): listens (registered with EPMD) for the stock node; serves inbox; a proxy for the stock node's outbox
node   beesl@localhost
peer   stock@localhost 127.0.0.1 22810 listen
remote outbox @ stock@localhost cast { op: atom, n: int64 }
local  inbox cast { op: atom, n: int64 }
